{19}{I won't say this again, human.  You are welcome to walk the tree-city, but if you cause any trouble here, you will be punished to the full extent of elven law.  [The guard's hand moves to the hilt of his sword.]  Your kind has taken much from us already.  You may pass...}{I won't say this again, human.  You are welcome to walk the tree-city, but if you cause any trouble here, you will be punished to the full extent of elven law.  [The guard's hand moves to the hilt of his sword.]  Your kind has taken much from us already.  You may pass...}{}{}{}{}
{20}{Good day...}{}{5}{}{-7}{}
{22}{Listen, dwarf...[The elf guard thinly disguises his disgust.]...all are welcome here in this place.  Even you.  But if you upset even one leaf in the sacred tree-city, I will throw you from her walls myself.  Are we clear?  Good.  You may pass...}{Listen, dwarf...[The elf guard thinly disguises his disgust.]...all are welcome here in this place.  Even you.  But if you upset even one leaf in the sacred tree-city, I will throw you from her walls myself.  Are we clear?  Good.  You may pass...}{}{}{}{}
{23}{Good day...}{}{5}{}{-7}{}
{25}{Welcome, elf-brother.  It is good to see one of our kind visit the sacred tree-city.  Feel free to walk her paths and enjoy her.  You may pass...}{Welcome, elf-sister.  It is good to see one of our kind visit the sacred tree-city.  Feel free to walk her paths and enjoy her.  You may pass...}{}{}{}{}
{26}{Good day...}{}{5}{}{-7}{}
{28}{[The guard extends his hand, but seems a bit stand-offish.]  Welcome, elf-kin.  All are welcome here, even our more distant...cousins.  You may pass...}{[The guard extends his hand, but seems a bit stand-offish.]  Welcome, elf-kin.  All are welcome here, even our more distant...cousins.  You may pass...}{}{}{}{}
{29}{Good day...}{}{5}{}{-7}{}
{31}{It is always a pleasure to have the gnomes walk among us in the tree-city.  We are both creatures of the old magicks.  You may pass...}{It is always a pleasure to have the gnomes walk among us in the tree-city.  We are both creatures of the old magicks.  You may pass...}{}{}{}{}
{32}{Good day...}{}{5}{}{-7}{}
{34}{[The guards leans down to you, smiling.]  Ah!  Long has it been since a halfling walked among us in the tree-city.  We welcome you, halfling brother.  You may pass...}{[The guards leans down to you, smiling.]  Ah!  Long has it been since a halfling walked among us in the tree-city.  We welcome you, halfling sister.  You may pass...}{}{}{}{}
{35}{Good day...}{}{5}{}{-7}{}
{37}{[The guard leans to you, hand on the hilt of his sword.]  Were it my choice, orc, you'd not be allowed into the sacred tree-city.  But elven law allows even your kind to enter Qintarra.  [He whispers menacingly...]  I sincerely hope you give me an excuse to remove you.  You may pass...}{[The guard leans to you, hand on the hilt of his sword.]  Were it my choice, orc, you'd not be allowed into the sacred tree-city.  But elven law allows even your kind to enter Qintarra.  [He whispers menacingly...]  I sincerely hope you give me an excuse to remove you.  You may pass...}{}{}{}{}
{38}{Good day...}{}{5}{}{-7}{}
{40}{[The guard seems a bit stand-offish.]  Welcome, half-ogre.  All are welcome here.  Even you.  Just watch yourself, and behave within the tree-city.  This is a sacred place.  You may pass...}{[The guard seems a bit stand-offish.]  Welcome, half-ogre.  All are welcome here.  Even you.  Just watch yourself, and behave within the tree-city.  This is a sacred place.  You may pass...}{}{}{}{}
{41}{Good day...}{}{5}{}{-7}{}
